{
 "title": "Viewing Your User Profile",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html\n  SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\" dir=\"ltr\"><head><title>Viewing Your User Profile</title><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"You can view your basic account profile information within guided buying.\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"You can view your basic account profile information within guided buying.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen,projection\" href=\"/resource/css/style-v2.css\"><script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"js/sap-strings.js\"></script></head><body class=\"en-us sap-light centered navigation-default enumeration-disabled collapsify-enabled\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-container\" class=\"container_12\" role=\"application\"><div id=\"d4h5-section-container\" class=\"grid_12\"><div id=\"d4h5-main-content\" class=\"grid_8 alpha omega\"><section><div class=\"page task  - topic-topic task-task \" id=\"loio6d3dd3fe821a4bfabc3d1225fb09bcc8\"><h1 class=\"title topictitle1\">Viewing Your User Profile</h1><div class=\"body taskbody\"><p class=\"shortdesc\">You can view your basic account profile information within guided buying.</p>\n<div class=\"section context\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Context</h2></div>\n<p class=\"p\">View your basic account profile to ensure that you're in the correct business unit and that\nyour email address and ship-to address are correct.</p>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section procedure\"><span id=\"steps\" class=\"anchor\"></span><div class=\"ol steps tasklabel\"><h2 class=\"sectiontitle tasklabel\">Procedure</h2></div><ol class=\"ol steps\"><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">From the guided buying home page, select the user icon, and then choose <span class=\"ph menucascade\"><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstart.gif\" alt=\"Start of the navigation path\" title=\"Start of the navigation path\"><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">App settings</span>&nbsp;<img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navstep.gif\" alt=\"Next navigation step\" title=\"Next navigation step\">&nbsp;<span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">View your profile</span><img src=\"themes/sap-light/img/navend.gif\" alt=\"End of the navigation path\" title=\"End of the navigation path\"></span>, as shown in the following figure.</span>\n<div class=\"itemgroup info\">\n<p class=\"p\"><img class=\"inline\" id=\"loio6d3dd3fe821a4bfabc3d1225fb09bcc8__image_zc1_lpm_h2c\" src=\"loiob6ce19a7524440d89119f8199a9b5804_LowRes.png\" alt=\"The user menu displays a two tiered menu with the app settings and view your profile options selected.\" title=\"The user menu displays a two tiered menu with the app settings and view your profile options selected.\"></p>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Your profile displays the following information:</span>\n\n<ul class=\"ul\">\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Personal information</span>: Name and email\naddress.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Organization information</span>: Release authority,\nplant, company code, purchasing organizaiton, and purchasing group.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Account information</span>: Purchasing unit, GL account, and cost\ncenter.</p></li>\n<li class=\"li\"><p><span class=\"ph uicontrol uicontrol-boldblack\">Shipping and delivery information</span>: Plant (shipping) and deliver-to\naddress.</p></li>\n</ul>\n\n</li><li class=\"li step stepexpand\">\n<span class=\"ph cmd\">Review your profile information. If you need to make changes, see <a class=\"xref\" href=\"826ab312824b4f5d854984c4cd2dd002.html\" title=\"You can make changes to your user profile, like updating your contact information or delivery address.\">Changing Your User Profile</a>.</span>\n</li></ol></section>\n</div></div></section><div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div></div></div></body></html>"
}